ior College Athletic Association, Division III Region 10, which includes North Carolina, South Carolina and Virginia. The team plays a schedule running February-May each spring with around 50-56 games before postseason play.</p>
</div></div></div></div> <div id="topslide_1" class=" widget_intelliwidget">  </div> <div id="content" class="center-page" ><div id="cnr3e" class="row" ><div id="cnr3f" class="col-md-3 section-sidebar py-5 pr-4" > <div id="submenu_2" class=" widget_intelliwidget"> <ul class="">

