</div><div id="lp5" class="col-md-9 section-body-border py-5 pl-5" ><div id="post-7977" class="post-7977 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry  post-seq-1 odd">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Spring 2025</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Rockingham Community College Baseball&#8217;s Spring 2025 Season is underway! We would love to see you at games this fall supporting the Eagles! Enjoy a game at beautiful Gilliland Field this spring!<br></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Head Baseball Coach: Daniel Huff- <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="fe968b98989acbc7cbc6be8c919d95979099969f939d9dd09b9a8b">[email&#160;protected]</a></li>



<li>Assistant Coach: Jim Richardson</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Field Address: </strong> 562 County Home Road Wentworth, NC 27375<br><strong>Restrooms available:  </strong>Portable Restrooms and in the Owens Building<br></p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Recent Years Successes</strong><br>2018-2019-2021</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Region 10 Champions<br>Mid-Atlantic District Champions<br>NJCAA DIII World Series Appearances </p>



